applications in certain countries, internet shutdowns, or other actions by governments that affect the accessibility of our
products in their countries (for example, beginning in 2022, our user growth and engagement were adversely affected by
the war in Ukraine and service restrictions imposed by the Russian government);
• we fail to provide adequate customer service to users, marketers, developers, or other partners;

